	(text_box "Info:\n\nRequirements:\n- Shall operate between 14V - 36V with nominal operation of 22V\n- Shall contain reverse polarity protection\n- Shall contain voltage transient/surge protection from 50V OV conditions\n- Shall contain undervoltage lockout at 12V\n- Shall contain soft start current protection\n- Shall contain inrush current limiter\n- Shall leverage teensy 4.0 microcontroller daughter board\n- Shall be able to operate four 9G servos with each 2A stall current\n- Shall be able to operat have four ESC with 30A max each\n- Target aircraft host shall be HEEWING F-01 Ultra Delta Wing\n- Target receiver FrSky XM+ 2.4GHz Micro Rx Sbus, 5V 70mA"
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 15.24 20.32 0)
		(size 91.44 53.34)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 255 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1d6713fe-67c9-4426-8e00-e46eaf42cedf")
	)
	(text_box "Draft Revision Notes:\n- Add 2nd servo bus 5V0 regulator\n- Add 0ohm resistor at output of 5V0 regulators for Pi Filter option\n- Change ESC RTN FET to SQJ116E, single channel N-FET\n- Remove voltage divider at N-FET fates and replae with 1kohm pull down\n- Remove servo enable opto-coupler, signal drive from the uC\n- Add LED health indicator for new servo bus\n- Add pull up to main 5V0 regulator\n- Add DNP voltage divider to main 5V0 regulator for UVLO feature\n- Add 0ohm GNSS RFin\n- Add receiver pin header"
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 15.24 149.86 0)
		(size 91.44 53.34)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
